#. あ、十神クン…！
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, Byakuya!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0002 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. あのさ、ちょっと話を聞きたいんだけど…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Listen, do you think we could talk?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0004 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 十神…クン…？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Byakuya...?"
msgstr ""

#. 今は、お前に話す事など何もない。
msgctxt "0006 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I have nothing to talk to you about."
msgstr ""

#. 馴れ馴れしく話しかけるな…
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Don't talk to me as if we're friends."
msgstr ""

#. あ、十神クン！　待ってよ！！
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "H-Hey, Byakuya! Wait!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もちろん、十神クンは待つ事なく、
#. そのまま歩き去ってしまった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But of course he didn't. He just walked away.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. どう…して…？
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What the...?"
msgstr ""

#. ど、どうして…あんな…
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Why was he acting like that?"
msgstr ""

#. ボクを…避けるみたいな態度で…？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Like he was purposely trying to avoid me..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. こんな物に構ってる場合じゃない！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have time to waste staring into this stupid\n"
"surveillance camera...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これがすべて、未解決事件の捜査報告書か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>These are a bunch of investigation reports related to\n"
"different cold cases.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、今は気にする事じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I don't have time to think about this right now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>“真の支配者層”についての資料…
#. 一般人が触れてはいけない世界の真実…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a document about the \"secret council\" revealing\n"
"the kind of truth a commoner shouldn't go near...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、今は気にする事じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I don't have time to think about this right now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 今はこの棚の書類を調べるよりも、
#. 他にやるべき事があるな…
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I have better things to do right now than sort through\n"
"a bunch of old files."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>電気スタンドだけど…
#. こんな物を気にしている場合じゃないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't imagine how this lamp is at all important\n"
"right now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>木箱の中身は…空のままだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The wooden box...is still empty.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0022 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0023 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>書庫から出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the archive?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
